<p>STERLING/MARK     1-MTH	3-MTH	6-MTH	12-MTH</p>
<p>Mean		  3.0527     3.0372     2.9628     2.8361</p>
<p>Minimum	     2.8836     2.8847     2.7506     2.5500</p>
<p>Maximum	     3.2300     3.3540     3.7170     3.2800</p>
<p>MARK/YEN	    1-MTH	3-MTH	6-MTH	12-MTH</p>
